# The API servers distribute.sh puts a database on. Copy to servers.conf beside this file and fill in
# the real hosts; servers.conf is not in this repository.
#
# The same servers as the inventory in unipept-api's .deploy, laid out the same way as far as this
# needs, but a copy of its own: each repository is deployed from its own checkout.
#
# Every server has the scripts .deploy/server/opensearch/install.sh installs, in /opt/unipept-database, and
# distribute.sh logs in as the user who owns the databases there. Everything a server decides, where
# its databases are and how it reaches the host it clones from, is in its
# /opt/unipept-database/etc/deploy.conf. A third field names another install root, for a server
# whose scripts are installed somewhere else.
#
# Servers are handled in the order listed.
#
# name   host
patty    patty.ugent.be
selma    selma.ugent.be
rick     rick.ugent.be
